  "titleText": {
    "es": "La ciencia debería ser exactamente tan guay como suenan los titulares. Como lo de «LOS RUSOS DESMEMBRAN UN PERRO Y LO VUELVEN A ENSAMBLAR».",
    "en": "Science should be exactly as cool as the headlines sound.  Like the 'RUSSIANS CUT APART AND REASSEMBLE DOGS' thing.",
    "noteEn": "The title text jokes that scientific results ought to be as literally dramatic as sensational headlines make them sound, using an intentionally gruesome Russian-dog example."
  },
