      "promptEs": "que",
      "answerEn": "no separate English word here; completes cada vez que, “every time”",
      "noteEn": "Inside cada vez que, que connects “every time” to the event that triggers the repeated result. It is written without an accent because it connects the two parts rather than asking a question.",
